OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner freed after court rules
OL,4,Asentence unlawful
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been released from prison
OL,7,Fafter being unlawfully detained for
OL,8,Falmost 18 years.
OL,10,FNiki Haycock, 47, from Hull, was jailed
OL,11,Fin 2006 under an imprisonment for
OL,12,Fpublic protection (IPP) sentence after
OL,13,Fhe pleaded guilty to controlling
OL,14,Fprostitution for gain and two counts of
OL,15,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm.
OL,17,FIPP sentences were indeterminate
OL,18,Fsentences intended for people
OL,19,Fconsidered dangerous, but whose offence
OL,20,Fdid not merit a life sentence,
OL,21,Faccording to the Prison Reform Trust.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
