OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner freed after court rules
OL,4,Asentence unlawful
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, the Court of Appeal quashed
OL,7,FHaycock's IPP sentence after ruling it
OL,8,Fwas "unlawful".
